Section: libs
Priority: optional
Depends: libqt6core6t64 (>= 6.8), libqt6gui6 (>= 6.8), libqt6qml6 (>= 6.8), libqt6quick6 (>= 6.8), libqt6dbus6 (>= 6.8), libstdc++6, libc6,
 qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-shapes,
 qml6-module-qtquick-window, qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript, qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami, fonts-inter, fonts-jetbrains-mono
Description: CybroidOS's own app controls and theme (Cybroid.Ui)
 The QML module every CybroidOS app is built from: the controls (cards, rows,
 switches, sliders, buttons, fields, choices) drawn in CybroidOS's two designs,
 Horizon and Hex, each Dark or Light and following the desktop live, and the
 native layer that runs the system's tools for them.
